Infects the target with a corrosive worm for 6 turns that reduces blight and acid resistance by [3%, 9%, 14%, 17%, 20% (TL1-5)] and feeds off damage taken.

When this effect ends or the target dies the worm will explode, dealing [34, 46, 55, 63, 70 (TL1-5; SP 100)] acid damage in a 4 radius ball. This damage will increase by [25%, 34%, 41%, 47%, 52% (TL1-5; SP 100)] of all damage taken while infected.

The damage dealt by the effect will increase with spellpower.
